WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
A fixed base, rigid arm, and payload. The drawing alone does not reveal where command delay enters.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.500
The command path is q_des into fixed PD, then a 0.080 s buffer, then the pendulum. c is the command; tau is the delayed input.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Now read back the recorded signals: the orange actuator input is the yellow torque command shifted later by exactly 0.080 s.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.767
This is an effective command delay at this boundary, not an electromagnetic motor time constant.
